The bug report and code snippets suggest that the context menu is not appearing or functioning as expected. The issue seems to be related to the visibility and positioning of the context menu. The `menuVisible` state is not being toggled correctly, and the positioning logic might not be applied properly, causing the menu to not render or appear off-screen.

